chapter.v:
	Finally then, 

	 brethren, we urge and exhort in the Lord Jesus that you should abound more and more, just as you received from us how you ought to walk and to please God;
 [1 Tim. 1:2]

	For this 

	 is the will of God, your sanctification: that you should abstain from sexual immorality;
 [2 Tim. 4:5]

	not in 

	 passion of lust, like the Gentiles who do not know God;
 [[1 Cor. 9:25]]

	But concerning 

	 brotherly love you have no need that I should write to you, for you yourselves are taught by God to love one another;
 [Acts 9:16 l Eph.]
